\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Lora , in general, is working with vigram. Or rather, Vigram is Lora\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s chief servant (or so he thinks). }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The whole testing him to see how tethered he is to flesh feels poorly motivated.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Because it feels unnecessary. You already have the test. Don\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t need to do two. This is redundant.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Lora expresses some concern about causing Mandri to go through the test.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 \hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 the most sacreligious thing imaginable\\}
