\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 2.) Girl is seducing Mandri}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 3.) Mandri is rescued from death by the introduction of an ox.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 1.) Lora is trying to seduce Mandri to determine how tethered he is to his flesh}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \tab -Is there not another way she could have gone about this? Why this way?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 2.) At the decisive moment, an ox intervenes}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 3.) }
